  id: aircon
  title: 2. Window Unit, Moving Vehicle
  region: South Sunsprawl
  briefing: Customer states the AC works only downhill. Recover three components
    from an illegal mobile HVAC conversion before the finance patrol confiscates
    the evidence.
  opening: 'Mara: There is a window air conditioner strapped to the roof. Its extension
    cord goes into the alternator. We are going to need three different tools.'
  midpoint: 'Bea: He used the condenser as a spoiler. It makes measurable downforce.
    Unfortunately the measurement is one.'
  closing: 'Mara: We restored the factory AC. The customer says it lacks the old
    system''s sense of occasion.'
  optionalObjective: Finish with at least 65% chassis health
